 <li><strong>Table DWH_RCNCN_POINT</strong><br><br>
   Definition of a Reconciliation Point e.g.<br><br><span class=3D"confluen=
ce-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"con=
fluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"37" src=3D"39dc25542d=
5f31febbd640a4707ae8ead480abbf0e2d57c351aec4ea785fdfd5" data-image-src=3D"/=
download/attachments/95301219/image2020-10-19_12-57-38.png?version=3D1&amp;=
