"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"95301219" data-linked-reso=
urce-container-version=3D"11" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span>=
<br><br></li>
 <li><strong>Table DWH_RCNCN_POINT_DETAIL</strong><br><br>
