nked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"ima=
ge2020-10-19_13-34-57.png" data-base-url=3D"https://confluence.group.net" d=
ata-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-contain=
er-id=3D"95301219" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"11" tabindex=
=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468" height=3D"86"></span><br><br></li>
 <li><strong>Table DWH_RCNCN_EXCTN_POINT</strong><br><br>
   Defines the point in the schedule where the Reconciliation Point (and as=
