<ul>
 <li><strong>Table DWH_LOGGING_POINT_EXCLN</strong></li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 30.0px;">Used to exclude Quotes, Policies and Invo=
ices with known issues from the reconciliation process e.g.</p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 30.0px;"><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-w=
rapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-i=
mage" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"59" src=3D"a7b259fecc05135dd0079a9f4def=
d2a5636da9ac1561389145e5192bb52d93a2" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachmen=
ts/95301219/image2020-10-19_13-43-19.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=
